    <entry>
      <title>x86环境下PEB和TEB结构体概述</title>
      <link href="//posts/x86-peb-teb-overview/"/>
      <url>//posts/x86-peb-teb-overview/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="摘要"><a href="#摘要" class="headerlink" title="摘要"></a>摘要</h2><p>PEB(进程环境块)与TEB(线程环境块)是windows中的重要数据结构，也是windows逆向工程和反调试相关的基础。</p><h2 id="正文"><a href="#正文" class="headerlink" title="正文"></a>正文</h2><h3 id="TEB（Thread-Environment-Block，线程环境块）"><a href="#TEB（Thread-Environment-Block，线程环境块）" class="headerlink" title="TEB（Thread Environment Block，线程环境块）"></a>TEB（Thread Environment Block，线程环境块）</h3><p>TEB包含进程中运行线程的各种信息，比如栈边界，SEH链，TLS指针，所属进程的PEB指针等，进程中的每个线程都对应一个TEB结构体。<br>以下是MSDN官方关于TEB结构体的说明：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">typedef struct _TEB &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  PVOID Reserved1[12];</span><br><span class="line">  PPEB  ProcessEnvironmentBlock;</span><br><span class="line">  PVOID Reserved2[399];</span><br><span class="line">  BYTE  Reserved3[1952];</span><br><span class="line">  PVOID TlsSlots[64];</span><br><span class="line">  BYTE  Reserved4[8];</span><br><span class="line">  PVOID Reserved5[26];</span><br><span class="line">  PVOID ReservedForOle;</span><br><span class="line">  PVOID Reserved6[4];</span><br><span class="line">  PVOID TlsExpansionSlots;</span><br><span class="line">&#125; TEB, *PTEB;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>其中 Reservedx 相关字段被遮盖，没有太多有用的信息。<br>本机的 x86 _TEB结构大概如下：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br><span class="line">63</span><br><span class="line">64</span><br><span class="line">65</span><br><span class="line">66</span><br><span class="line">67</span><br><span class="line">68</span><br><span class="line">69</span><br><span class="line">70</span><br><span class="line">71</span><br><span class="line">72</span><br><span class="line">73</span><br><span class="line">74</span><br><span class="line">75</span><br><span class="line">76</span><br><span class="line">77</span><br><span class="line">78</span><br><span class="line">79</span><br><span class="line">80</span><br><span class="line">81</span><br><span class="line">82</span><br><span class="line">83</span><br><span class="line">84</span><br><span class="line">85</span><br><span class="line">86</span><br><span class="line">87</span><br><span class="line">88</span><br><span class="line">89</span><br><span class="line">90</span><br><span class="line">91</span><br><span class="line">92</span><br><span class="line">93</span><br><span class="line">94</span><br><span class="line">95</span><br><span class="line">96</span><br><span class="line">97</span><br><span class="line">98</span><br><span class="line">99</span><br><span class="line">100</span><br><span class="line">101</span><br><span class="line">102</span><br><span class="line">103</span><br><span class="line">104</span><br><span class="line">105</span><br><span class="line">106</span><br><span class="line">107</span><br><span class="line">108</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">typedef struct _TEB32 &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    NT_TIB32      NtTib;                           /* 0x000 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      EnvironmentPointer;              /* 0x01C */</span><br><span class="line">    CLIENT_ID32   ClientId;                        /* 0x020 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ActiveRpcHandle;                 /* 0x028 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ThreadLocalStoragePointer;       /* 0x02C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ProcessEnvironmentBlock;         /* 0x030 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      LastErrorValue;                  /* 0x034 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      CountOfOwnedCriticalSections;    /* 0x038 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      CsrClientThread;                 /* 0x03C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      Win32ThreadInfo;                 /* 0x040 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      User32Reserved[26];              /* 0x044 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      UserReserved[5];                 /* 0x0AC */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      WOW32Reserved;                   /* 0x0C0 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      CurrentLocale;                   /* 0x0C4 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      FpSoftwareStatusRegister;        /* 0x0C8 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ReservedForDebuggerInstrumentation[16]; /* 0x0CC */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      SystemReserved1[21];             /* 0x10C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      HeapFlsData;                     /* 0x160 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      RngState[4];                     /* 0x164 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       PlaceholderCompatibilityMode;    /* 0x174 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       PlaceholderHydrationAlwaysExplicit; /* 0x175 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       PlaceholderReserved[10];         /* 0x176 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ProxiedProcessId;                /* 0x180 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       ActivationStack[0x18];           /* 0x184 _ACTIVATION_CONTEXT_STACK */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       WorkingOnBehalfTicket[8];        /* 0x19C */</span><br><span class="line">    int32_t       ExceptionCode;                   /* 0x1A4 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ActivationContextStackPointer;   /* 0x1A8 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      InstrumentationCallbackSp;       /* 0x1AC */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      InstrumentationCallbackPreviousPc; /* 0x1B0 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      InstrumentationCallbackPreviousSp; /* 0x1B4 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       InstrumentationCallbackDisabled; /* 0x1B8 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       SpareBytes[0x17];                /* 0x1B9 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      TxFsContext;                     /* 0x1D0 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       GdiTebBatch[0x4E0];              /* 0x1D4 _GDI_TEB_BATCH */</span><br><span class="line">    CLIENT_ID32   RealClientId;                    /* 0x6B4 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      GdiCachedProcessHandle;          /* 0x6BC */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      GdiClientPID;                    /* 0x6C0 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      GdiClientTID;                    /* 0x6C4 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      GdiThreadLocalInfo;              /* 0x6C8 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      Win32ClientInfo[62];             /* 0x6CC */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      glDispatchTable[233];            /* 0x7C4 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      glReserved1[29];                 /* 0xB68 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      glReserved2;                     /* 0xBDC */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      glSectionInfo;                   /* 0xBE0 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      glSection;                       /* 0xBE4 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      glTable;                         /* 0xBE8 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      glCurrentRC;                     /* 0xBEC */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      glContext;                       /* 0xBF0 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      LastStatusValue;                 /* 0xBF4 */</span><br><span class="line">    UNICODE_STRING32 StaticUnicodeString;          /* 0xBF8 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint16_t      StaticUnicodeBuffer[261];        /* 0xC00 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       Padding0[2];                     /* 0xE0A */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      DeallocationStack;               /* 0xE0C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      TlsSlots[64];                    /* 0xE10 */</span><br><span class="line">    LIST_ENTRY32  TlsLinks;                        /* 0xF10 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      Vdm;                             /* 0xF18 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ReservedForNtRpc;                /* 0xF1C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      DbgSsReserved[2];                /* 0xF20 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      HardErrorMode;                   /* 0xF28 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      Instrumentation[9];              /* 0xF2C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       ActivityId[0x10];                /* 0xF50 _GUID */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      SubProcessTag;                   /* 0xF60 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      PerflibData;                     /* 0xF64 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      EtwTraceData;                    /* 0xF68 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      WinSockData;                     /* 0xF6C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      GdiBatchCount;                   /* 0xF70 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      CurrentIdealProcessor;           /* 0xF74 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      GuaranteedStackBytes;            /* 0xF78 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ReservedForPerf;                 /* 0xF7C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ReservedForOle;                  /* 0xF80 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      WaitingOnLoaderLock;             /* 0xF84 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      SavedPriorityState;              /* 0xF88 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ReservedForCodeCoverage;         /* 0xF8C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ThreadPoolData;                  /* 0xF90 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      TlsExpansionSlots;               /* 0xF94 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      MuiGeneration;                   /* 0xF98 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      IsImpersonating;                 /* 0xF9C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      NlsCache;                        /* 0xFA0 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      pShimData;                       /* 0xFA4 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      HeapData;                        /* 0xFA8 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      CurrentTransactionHandle;        /* 0xFAC */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ActiveFrame;                     /* 0xFB0 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      FlsData;                         /* 0xFB4 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      PreferredLanguages;              /* 0xFB8 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      UserPrefLanguages;               /* 0xFBC */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      MergedPrefLanguages;             /* 0xFC0 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      MuiImpersonation;                /* 0xFC4 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint16_t      CrossTebFlags;                   /* 0xFC8 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint16_t      SameTebFlags;                    /* 0xFCA */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      TxnScopeEnterCallback;           /* 0xFCC */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      TxnScopeExitCallback;            /* 0xFD0 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      TxnScopeContext;                 /* 0xFD4 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      LockCount;                       /* 0xFD8 */</span><br><span class="line">    int32_t       WowTebOffset;                    /* 0xFDC */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ResourceRetValue;                /* 0xFE0 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ReservedForWdf;                  /* 0xFE4 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint64_t      ReservedForCrt;                  /* 0xFE8 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       EffectiveContainerId[0x10];      /* 0xFF0 _GUID */</span><br><span class="line">    uint64_t      LastSleepCounter;                /* 0x1000 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      SpinCallCount;                   /* 0x1008 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       Padding1[4];                     /* 0x100C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint64_t      ExtendedFeatureDisableMask;      /* 0x1010 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      SchedulerSharedDataSlot;         /* 0x1018 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      HeapWalkContext;                 /* 0x101C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       PrimaryGroupAffinity[0x0C];      /* 0x1020 _GROUP_AFFINITY */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      Rcu[2];                          /* 0x102C */</span><br><span class="line">&#125; TEB32;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>可见结构体的成员多且复杂， 这里只需要了解两个成员：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">NT_TIB32      NtTib;                           /* 0x000 */</span><br><span class="line">uint32_t      ProcessEnvironmentBlock;         /* 0x030 */</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>其中开头的 NtTib 也是一个结构体，定义如下：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">typedef struct _NT_TIB32 &#123;                    /* sizeof = 0x1C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t ExceptionList;                   /* 0x00 SEH 链头 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t StackBase;                       /* 0x04  */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t StackLimit;                      /* 0x08  */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t SubSystemTib;                    /* 0x0C  */</span><br><span class="line">    union &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        uint32_t FiberData;                   /* 0x10 */</span><br><span class="line">        uint32_t Version;                     /* 0x10 */</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;;</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t ArbitraryUserPointer;            /* 0x14 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t Self;                            /* 0x18 ← fs:[0x18] */</span><br><span class="line">&#125; NT_TIB32;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>ExceptionList：指向 _EXCEPTION_REGISTRATION_RECORD 结构体组成的链表，它用于Windows OS的SEH<br>Self：_NT_TIB 结构体的自引用指针，也是TEB结构体的指针<br>下面通过一段c代码来尝试访问TEB结构体</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;windows.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;winternl.h&gt;</span> <span class="comment">// 包含 _TEB 结构体定义</span></span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">main</span><span class="params">()</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    HMODULE hNtdll = LoadLibraryA(<span class="string">&quot;ntdll.dll&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> (hNtdll == <span class="literal">NULL</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;LoadLibrary failed, error: %lu\n&quot;</span>, GetLastError());</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 32位 NtCurrentTeb 是导出函数，使用 __stdcall 调用约定</span></span><br><span class="line">    TEB* (__stdcall *lpNtCurrentTeb)(<span class="type">void</span>) =</span><br><span class="line">        (TEB* (__stdcall *)(<span class="type">void</span>))GetProcAddress(hNtdll, <span class="string">&quot;NtCurrentTeb&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> (lpNtCurrentTeb == <span class="literal">NULL</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;GetProcAddress failed. This should NOT happen on 32-bit.\n&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        FreeLibrary(hNtdll);</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    </span><br><span class="line">    TEB* pTEB = lpNtCurrentTeb();</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;TEB addr (via GetProcAddress): %p\n&quot;</span>, pTEB);</span><br><span class="line">    fflush(<span class="built_in">stdout</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    </span><br><span class="line">    FreeLibrary(hNtdll);</span><br><span class="line">    getchar();</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>ntdll.dll</code> 是 Windows 底层的核心动态链接库，包含了大量的原生 API，这里我们需要用到它导出表的<code>NtCurrentTeb</code>函数<br>用 MinGW-w64 i686 将该源码编译成PE32，运行之后打印<br>TEB addr (via GetProcAddress): 008D6000<br>发现实际并无啥用，然后可以在x32dbg中调试<br><img src="/posts/x86-peb-teb-overview/x32dbg.png"><br>可以看到，NtCurrentTeb()函数的内部代码非常简单，只返回 FS:[0x18] 的值<br>其中，FS是段寄存器，(x64的话对应的是GS段寄存器)间接指向TEB地址，于是我们得到</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">FS:[0x18] = TEB起始地址</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>再整理一下，结合FS:0也指向TEB开头，可以理解以下公式</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">FS:[0x18] = TEB.NtTib.Self = address of TIB = address of TEB = FS:0</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>话再说回来前面没有提到的重要成员之二：ProcessEnvironmentBlock，这个就是该TEB对应线程所属的进程的PEB（似乎有点绕口），又可以发现</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">FS:[0x30] = TEB.ProcessEnvironmentBlock = address of PEB</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="PEB（Process-Environment-Block，进程环境块）"><a href="#PEB（Process-Environment-Block，进程环境块）" class="headerlink" title="PEB（Process Environment Block，进程环境块）"></a>PEB（Process Environment Block，进程环境块）</h3><p>PEB是存放进程信息的结构体，包含镜像基址、模块链表、命令行、环境变量、堆、是否被调试等信息<br>在MSDN上对PEB的描述如下：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">typedef struct _PEB &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  BYTE                          Reserved1[2];</span><br><span class="line">  BYTE                          BeingDebugged;</span><br><span class="line">  BYTE                          Reserved2[1];</span><br><span class="line">  PVOID                         Reserved3[2];</span><br><span class="line">  PPEB_LDR_DATA                 Ldr;</span><br><span class="line">  PRTL_USER_PROCESS_PARAMETERS  ProcessParameters;</span><br><span class="line">  PVOID                         Reserved4[3];</span><br><span class="line">  PVOID                         AtlThunkSListPtr;</span><br><span class="line">  PVOID                         Reserved5;</span><br><span class="line">  ULONG                         Reserved6;</span><br><span class="line">  PVOID                         Reserved7;</span><br><span class="line">  ULONG                         Reserved8;</span><br><span class="line">  ULONG                         AtlThunkSListPtr32;</span><br><span class="line">  PVOID                         Reserved9[45];</span><br><span class="line">  BYTE                          Reserved10[96];</span><br><span class="line">  PPS_POST_PROCESS_INIT_ROUTINE PostProcessInitRoutine;</span><br><span class="line">  BYTE                          Reserved11[128];</span><br><span class="line">  PVOID                         Reserved12[1];</span><br><span class="line">  ULONG                         SessionId;</span><br><span class="line">&#125; PEB, *PPEB;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>和TEB一样，又是一堆保留字段。。。<br>下面贴出PEB32的部分结构</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">typedef struct _PEB32 &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       InheritedAddressSpace;           /* 0x00 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       ReadImageFileExecOptions;        /* 0x01 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       BeingDebugged;                   /* 0x02 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       BitField;                        /* 0x03 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      Mutant;                          /* 0x04 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ImageBaseAddress;                /* 0x08 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      Ldr;                             /* 0x0C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ProcessParameters;               /* 0x10 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      SubSystemData;                   /* 0x14 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ProcessHeap;                     /* 0x18 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      FastPebLock;                     /* 0x1C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      AtlThunkSListPtr;                /* 0x20 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      IFEOKey;                         /* 0x24 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      CrossProcessFlags;               /* 0x28 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      KernelCallbackTable;             /* 0x2C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      SystemReserved;                  /* 0x30 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      AtlThunkSListPtr32;              /* 0x34 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ApiSetMap;                       /* 0x38 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      TlsExpansionCounter;             /* 0x3C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      TlsBitmap;                       /* 0x40 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      TlsBitmapBits[2];                /* 0x44 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ReadOnlySharedMemoryBase;        /* 0x4C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      SharedData;                      /* 0x50 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ReadOnlyStaticServerData;        /* 0x54 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      AnsiCodePageData;                /* 0x58 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      OemCodePageData;                 /* 0x5C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      UnicodeCaseTableData;            /* 0x60 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      NumberOfProcessors;              /* 0x64 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      NtGlobalFlag;                    /* 0x68  ← 经典反调试 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      Unused;                          /* 0x6C */</span><br><span class="line">    int64_t       CriticalSectionTimeout;          /* 0x70 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      HeapSegmentReserve;              /* 0x78 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      HeapSegmentCommit;               /* 0x7C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      HeapDeCommitTotalFreeThreshold;  /* 0x80 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      HeapDeCommitFreeBlockThreshold;  /* 0x84 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      NumberOfHeaps;                   /* 0x88 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      MaximumNumberOfHeaps;            /* 0x8C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ProcessHeaps;                    /* 0x90 */</span><br><span class="line">…………(未完待续)</span><br><span class="line">&#125; PEB32;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>我们主要研究以下结构体成员：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">BeingDebugged;                   /* 0x02 */</span><br><span class="line">ImageBaseAddress;                /* 0x08 */</span><br><span class="line">Ldr;                             /* 0x0C */</span><br><span class="line">ProcessHeap;                     /* 0x18 */</span><br><span class="line">NtGlobalFlag;                    /* 0x68 */</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="BeingDebugged："><a href="#BeingDebugged：" class="headerlink" title="BeingDebugged："></a>BeingDebugged：</h4><p>在最近的windows大版本中（win7之后？），KernelBase.dll 中（之前是在Kernel32.dll）有一个非常重要的api函数</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">BOOL WINAPI IsDebuggerPresent(void);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>顾名思义，该函数用来判断当前进程是否处于调试状态，判断根据就是读取PEB中的BeingDebugged这个值（<strong>是，则返回1；否，则返回0</strong>），该函数在ida中反汇编如下<br><img src="/posts/x86-peb-teb-overview/Pasted_image_20261101135047.png"><br>这个就是最简单的一种反调试方式，但是很多调试器都会把 PEB-&gt;BeingDebugged 的值修改为0，这样就可以轻松绕过该反调试</p><h4 id="ImageBaseAddress"><a href="#ImageBaseAddress" class="headerlink" title="ImageBaseAddress:"></a>ImageBaseAddress:</h4><p>该成员指向主模块（通常是.exe文件）在内存中的实际加载基址<br>我们要访问这个成员，需要</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">HMODULE __stdcall GetModuleHandleW(LPCWSTR SourceString)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这个windows api来访问它，函数反编译如下<br>![[Pasted image 20261101141037.png]]</p><h4 id="Ldr"><a href="#Ldr" class="headerlink" title="Ldr"></a>Ldr</h4><p>这是一个指向 _PEB_LDR_DATA 结构体的指针，该结构体的大致内容如下</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">typedef struct _PEB_LDR_DATA32 &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      Length;                          /* 0x00 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       Initialized;                     /* 0x04 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       Padding0[3];                     /* 0x05 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      SsHandle;                        /* 0x08 */</span><br><span class="line">    LIST_ENTRY32  InLoadOrderModuleList;           /* 0x0C */</span><br><span class="line">    LIST_ENTRY32  InMemoryOrderModuleList;         /* 0x14 */</span><br><span class="line">    LIST_ENTRY32  InInitializationOrderModuleList; /* 0x1C */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      EntryInProgress;                 /* 0x24 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       ShutdownInProgress;              /* 0x28 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint8_t       Padding1[3];                     /* 0x29 */</span><br><span class="line">    uint32_t      ShutdownThreadId;                /* 0x2C */</span><br><span class="line">&#125; PEB_LDR_DATA32;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这里面有三个 _LIST_ENTRY 类型的成员，这个结构体长这样：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">typedef struct _LIST_ENTRY &#123;</span><br><span class="line">struct _LIST_ENTRY *Flink;</span><br><span class="line">struct _LIST_ENTRY *Blink;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;   _LIST_ENTRY, *PLIST_ENTRY;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这个大概是提供了一个双向链表的机制，查阅了一下，上面三条双向链表的内容：</p><ul><li><code>InLoadOrderModuleList</code>含义：<strong>模块被加载的顺序</strong>。主 EXE 排第一，之后是按依赖关系加载的 DLL。</li><li><code>InMemoryOrderModuleList</code>含义：<strong>模块在虚拟内存中的地址顺序</strong>（基址从低到高）</li><li><code>InInitializationOrderModuleList</code>含义：<strong>模块 <code>DllMain</code> 被调用的顺序</strong>。</li></ul><h4 id="ProcessHeap"><a href="#ProcessHeap" class="headerlink" title="ProcessHeap"></a>ProcessHeap</h4><p>指针，指向进程的默认堆，这个堆的头部（_HEAP）结构体中，有两个字段 <code>Flags</code> 和 <code>ForceFlags</code> 和反调试相关</p><h4 id="NtGlobalFlag"><a href="#NtGlobalFlag" class="headerlink" title="NtGlobalFlag"></a>NtGlobalFlag</h4><p>这个<code>DWORD</code>的字段是更加直接的一个调试标志位，在进程正常运行时，该值通常为<code>0</code>，但是如果进程由调试器创建的话，它的值会被设置为<code>0x70</code>（常见典型值）</p>]]></content>
      
      
